Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.10,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,DUE TO POOR COMMUNICATION,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:05.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,LIFE BECOMES VERY DIFFICULT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:08.00,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,I WILL TELL YOU
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:10.20,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,ABOUT ONE SUCH CASE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:12.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,I AM DR. HYMA PRASAD,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,I'M A PSYCHOLOGIST.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:17.00,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,IN MY RECENT CASES,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:19.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,THERE WAS A BOY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:22.00,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE STUDIED VERY WELL,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.20,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,GOT GREAT MARKS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:26.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,EVERYTHING WAS PERFECT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:29.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,ON RECORD, HE WAS EXCELLENT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:31.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE WAS VERY GOOD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:34.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BUT WHEN SITTING TO TALK,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:37.00,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE FEARED ENGLISH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:39.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE FEARED SPEAKING TO OTHERS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:42.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE FEARED GOING TO COACHING.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:45.00,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WITH ALL THESE FEARS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:47.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE COULDN'T FACE INTERVIEWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.00,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE WENT TO INTERVIEWS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:52.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,AND FAILED REPEATEDLY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WHY IS THIS HAPPENING?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:58.20,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,ESPECIALLY THESE DAYS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.00,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,NO ONE SHOULD FEAR ENGLISH.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.00,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BECAUSE YOU STUDY IN ENGLISH.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,EVEN THEN, WHY FEAR?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:09.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WHY IS HE SCARED?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:12.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE MAGNIFIES THE INTERVIEWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:15.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE FEARS TALKING TO ANYONE.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:18.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WHY DOES THIS HAPPEN?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:21.20,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,YOU HAVE THE KNOWLEDGE,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:23.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BUT CAN'T EXPLAIN IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:26.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,SO HE FAILED MANY INTERVIEWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.80,0:01:30.00,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HERE IS HOW TO PRACTICE.
